    {
      "id": 217,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "README · Requirements and quick start",
      "pos": [
        520,
        -470
      ],
      "size": [
        1260,
        430
      ],
      "flags": {
        "pinned": true
      },
      "order": 16,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# H3 DIRECTOR STUDIO V2 — START HERE\n\n## Required before opening this workflow\n\n- **[ComfyUI-Pixaroma](https://gitlab.com/pixaroma/comfyui-pixaroma)** — required for the visible **Render Timer** node.\n- Current [ComfyUI](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI) with native MiniMax H3 support.\n- [ComfyUI-H3-Motion-Context](https://github.com/NikoDemon80/ComfyUI-H3-Motion-Context) — continuity for motion and audio.\n- [ComfyUI-OBVPM-Timeline](https://github.com/chanon/comfyui-obvpm-timeline) — context windows for the Upscale pass.\n- A compatible **MinimaxH3LatentUpscaler3D** provider.\n\n## Workflow node packages\n\n- [Deno custom nodes](https://github.com/Deno2026/comfyui-deno-custom-nodes) — reference image/audio loader.\n- [rgthree-comfy](https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy) — BASE and UPSCALE LoRA stacks.\n- [ComfyUI-Spectrum-MiniMax-H3](https://github.com/xmarre/ComfyUI-Spectrum-MiniMax-H3) — Spectrum, wired to BASE only.\n- [ComfyUI-KJNodes](https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes) — optional BASE preview.\n- [VideoHelperSuite](https://github.com/Kosinkadink/ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite) — final MP4 output.\n\n## Example model files shown in this workflow\n\n- **BASE:** `Minimax-h3_Singularity_ref2va_v1.3_Pruned_w4a8.safetensors`\n- **UPSCALE:** `10Eros_Max_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- **Video VAE:** `minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- **Audio VAE:** `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`\n- **Text Encoder:** `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors`\n\n## Quick use\n\n1. Add image/audio references, a global prompt and one prompt per segment.\n2. **Generate clip N** with the switch on BASE to review it; then use **Keep BASE → Upscale**.\n3. **Approve final → next clip** advances the selector. **Run Chain** continues automatically from the active clip.\n4. Seed mode is **Randomize**. Use **Lock current seed** only when you want to repeat a result.\n\nSpectrum is wired **only to BASE**. Use it with non-Turbo BASE sampling at around 25 steps; keep it out of the 3D latent-upscale branch.\n"
      ]
    }
